OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fbands of mostly light rain moving in
OL,7,Ffrom the northwest through this
OL,8,Fevening and overnight. The bands of
OL,9,Frain quickly clear during the early
OL,10,Fhours of Thursday morning, with some
OL,11,Fclearer spells following on behind.
OL,12,FWindy. Generally mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FA largely dry and bright
OL,15,Fstart. However, the clouds will build
OL,16,Fup to give some showers into the
OL,17,Fafternoon, mostly on western hills.
OL,18,FFeeling cool in the blustery winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
